WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,120
Research on flying pigs

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,760
If there is any new discovery

3
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:04,480
It must be synchronized to him as soon as possible

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:08,520
He wants core technical information. It's absolutely impossible. You're overthinking it.

5
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:11,080
He doesn’t want specific technical drawings and manufacturing processes

6
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:13,000
Just simple practical functions

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,680
For example, that pig's egg not only makes people want to fly

8
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,440
What else can it be used for?

9
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:18,720
You are so brave

10
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,240
Teasing me again and again

11
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,080
Treating the master of the country as a child's play

12
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:24,960
Captain Wu’s Hongmu family went to find you to mess with you.

13
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:28,280
I sent him a message seriously and without any lies. You are so angry with me.

14
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:31,640
You didn't leave the apartment building this morning and didn't use broadband.

15
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,080
I haven’t made any external calls to Yueyang.

16
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,200
How did you contact him?

17
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:38,050
The information you provided does not match the public information

18
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:39,450
We want to verify in person

19
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:40,930
However, documents will be produced in accordance with the law

20
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:44,900
We won't force entry into your home either.

21
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:48,050
Send me the snake smoke information and clothing.

22
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:55,940
I'll have the lawyers join me and I'll go over now
